/T (C++. C++ is the programming language used for the whole project. Besides the core language, the program uses a few parts of the standard library: vector for lists of game objects, string and stringstream for building text such as the score line, and cstring for the strlen function. The header algorithm is also included, although no function from it is called in the present version. Windows API. The Windows API \(also called Win32\) is the set of functions provided by Windows for creating windows and handling events. In this project it is used through windows.h. The program uses WinMain as the starting point, RegisterClassA and CreateWindowExA to create the window, a)
