>>
endobj
458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
/T (Together, these features make the game more engaging than a basic platform game with one level. The different worlds and the boss give the player goals to work towards, the score and lives create a sense of risk and reward, and the checkpoint and power-ups reduce frustration while still keeping the game challenging.)
/E (Together, these features make the game more engaging than a basic platform game with one level. The different worlds and the boss give the player goals to work towards, the score and lives create a sense of risk and reward, and the checkpoint and power-ups reduce frustration while still keeping the game challenging.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
