462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
/T (The game has Forest World, Desert World and Ice Kingdom. LoadStage builds a different layout of platforms and enemies for each world, so the player faces new challenges instead of repeating one level.)
/E (The game has Forest World, Desert World and Ice Kingdom. LoadStage builds a different layout of platforms and enemies for each world, so the player faces new challenges instead of repeating one level.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
/T (Each world has its own sky colour and decoration: green trees in the Forest, a sun in the Desert and pale snow mounds in the Ice Kingdom. This gives every world a clearly different look.)
/E (Each world has its own sky colour and decoration: green trees in the Forest, a sun in the Desert and pale snow mounds in the Ice Kingdom. This gives every world a clearly different look.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
