/E (The player starts with three lives. This allows mistakes while still making every enemy contact important.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
/T (Enemies patrol between fixed limits. Landing on an enemy from above defeats it and gives 20 points, while touching it from the side loses a life. The player must judge timing and position.)
/E (Enemies patrol between fixed limits. Landing on an enemy from above defeats it and gives 20 points, while touching it from the side loses a life. The player must judge timing and position.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
