/Title (The project also introduced graphics programming with the Windows API and GDI. Drawing the whole game from rectangles, circles and text, and using an off-screen buffer for smooth display, showed how a window application works in Windows. Testing the game while it was running helped in finding and correcting mistakes in the game logic.)
/Dest [43 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1459 0 R
/Prev 2351 0 R
/Next 2352 0 R
>>
